  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.1 writes HDR from HDR pixels: hdr.ToGainMapImage() computes an ISO 21496-1 gain map as libultrahdr 2.0.2 does (identical codes and metadata) over a tone-mapped or given SDR base, so an HdrImage saves as Ultra HDR JPEG (GainMapOptions: Scale, ChannelCount, Gamma, Headroom, ToneMapping); a public HdrImage constructor accepts pixels from plugins; Apple-only gain maps are now written and returned by GetGainMap() converted to ISO 21496-1. Existing files and outputs are otherwise unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.8.1/docs/releases/release-0.8.1.md",
